  "written_proof": "Sections 2-4 give the complete all-index A006077 argument. Corollaries 5-8 give the valuation and square classes, real translation and scale parameters, exact inertia and nullity, positive-real-order harmonic determinant signs, and both Bernoulli/Euler-square sign assertions. The coverage section also proves the order-two Franel assertion.",
